.TH SOAPUTIL 1 "September 2026" "Qore XML" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
soaputil \- inspect WSDL documents and generate example SOAP messages
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B soaputil
.RI [ options ] " wsdl " [ command " [" arguments ]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read a WSDL document and report its services and operations, generate a sample
message, or dump its parsed representation. Run with
.B \-\-help
for command-specific arguments and formatting options.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B report
Report WSDL definitions.
.TP
.B msg
Generate an example message for an operation.
.TP
.B dump
Dump the parsed WSDL representation.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display usage and supported command arguments.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
Enable verbose diagnostics.
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output= FILE
Write output to FILE.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR qore (1)
